[{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":5},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":10},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":6},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「朋也…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「朋也，快起床…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有人的声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过…并没有感觉到那直刺眼睛的耀眼阳光。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"试着睁开眼睛。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg009n2"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":9},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",320],"value":1},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…智代就在面前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么了啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「抱歉…天还没亮就把你叫起来了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要私奔吗…好，那走吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不对。虽然这好像也很有意思的样子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「从昨天起就一直在准备有关创立者祭的事情。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「所以今天也得大清早地就赶到学校，然后要帮忙到上课为止才行。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「刚刚当上学生会长才多少时间啊，有那么多工作吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「当然了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「而且，创立者祭原本就是前任学生会和新学生会第一次，同时也是最后一次的共同作业。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「所以在这里可以学到非常多有用的知识。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「是很重要的时间。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「原来如此…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「所以，今天早上也没办法一起去学校了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「当然如果朋也愿意的话，也可以这个时间一起去…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「现在几点啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「还不到６点。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「５点？我才没睡多少久啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯…慢慢休息吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不…上课时候补觉就行了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那可不行…我不允许这种事发生。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「还是继续睡吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好吧…既然你这么说，那也只能照做了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那…我先走了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「等等。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚打算站起来的智代，又一次弯下了膝盖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我将手勾在了智代的脖子上，将她拉了过来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对上了彼此的嘴唇。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没多久就结束了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那，晚安。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「嗯，好好加油吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代一人走了出去。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1118],"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg009"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",315],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当醒过来的时候，只有我一个人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（还真是寂寞呢…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我不否认自己还没睡够。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，不知道为什么，没办法就这么继续睡下去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「走吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从被窝里钻了出来。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg033a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（果然还是去把那家伙也叫起来好了…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（要只有我一个人不迟到去学校，感觉很不爽…）"},{"op":"background","image":"bg034"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg046"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",314],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「喂，起床。太阳晒屁股了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哈啊…！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"睁开眼睛的同时，春原一下就跳了起来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「早上好！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「今天一天也敬请您能多加指导，多加鞭策小弟！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「奇怪，不是智代妹妹啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没错，是我。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"等等，如果是智代的话，刚才你那打招呼的方式就很正常了吗…。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh20b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「智代妹妹呢？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「她说早上开始就要准备明天的事情。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哈啊…那迟到也无所谓了吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「再睡会儿？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯，我睡。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那，晚安。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「晚安。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原又钻进了被窝。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而当我正准备走出春原房间的时候。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「等等…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原又忽然直起了身子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么了？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「总觉得，睡不着了呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吗…那，一起走？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「是呢…难得那么早起来了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那快点准备吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「总觉得，又只剩两个大男人了，怪寂寞的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「就算是那样的女人，只是在这儿就会感觉气氛不一样了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真是意外的发现。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你在人家男朋友面前还说这种话啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊，抱歉抱歉。不过，智代妹妹也有可爱的一面的呢，嗯。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「帮我做便当啊，胸部也很大的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…胸部大也算是可爱之处吗。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「冈崎你就好了。就算摸了也不会被踢吧？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…不，从没碰过呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「真的假的？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…有问题吗？这是我的自由吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「是吗。你看上去就很保守的样子呢～」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那也就是说，吻也还没接过？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不如说，我根本没办法想象你们做那种事情的样子！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「要是你们默不作声就口对口的话，我会笑得打滚的，绝对！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…早上刚吻过就是了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「在离别之时，你突然对她说…『等等』什么的再吻别的话，那可就精彩极了！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"砰！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我用书包殴打了春原的后脑勺。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「干嘛啊！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「难不成，给我说中了！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「有只独角仙在你头上而已。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你是打算把它尸体贴我身上吗！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「可恶，看我怎么去和智代妹妹哭诉被你欺负的事情。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「下场只会是你被干掉吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「为什么啊！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嘁，结果…不还是卿卿我我的么…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「算是吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊ー啊，我也想要女朋友啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「痴人说梦话。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「别说那么绝啊！」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021h"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"上午的课上完后，迎来了放学。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就算明天是创立者祭，也和大多数三年级学生没有关系，纷纷踏上了归途。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一，二年级的学生，则忙忙碌碌地准备着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"主办方的学生会就更不用说了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「饿死了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「吃点什么后快点回去吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「行。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"创立者祭，也就是这里的学园祭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"斜眼看着正忙着准备各自班级展示物的学生们，我们走出了教室。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「明天还来吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「至少早上点名的时候要来吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那时候在一下，就能算一天的出席天数呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「也是…而且最近也习惯早起了…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过，这样下去的话感觉马上就会回到原本的样子。」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg046"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在附近的小餐馆吃完午饭后，直接来到了春原的房间，和之前一样懒懒散散地打发一天的时间。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg046n"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「我进来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘎吱。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"门打开后，智代出现在了面前。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「呜啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚才还懒洋洋地趴在床上的春原跳了起来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「结束了吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「还没。而且也看不到结束的迹象。现在是吃饭休息时间，我就溜出来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「让我在这里吃吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将便当店的袋子放在了被炉的上面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「看上去很辛苦呢…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「当然辛苦了。不过…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"坐下来后，将便当从袋子里拿了出来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「只靠少数人的力量来创造出能让许多人享受的快乐时间。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「那真的是非常有意义的事情。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「而实际上，我也很开心。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吗。那就好…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代开始吃便当。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「春原。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh19b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「抱歉，能不能帮忙泡杯茶呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「为什么要我来啊！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你之前不是吃了智代的便当吗？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯…确实是有这么个事…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「谢谢你，春原。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我还没答应说要去呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「算了，我去就是了。反正这么待着你们也会叫我出去的吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「这不是很懂嘛。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一脸不情愿的站了起来后，春原离开了房间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"剩下我们两人独处。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"智代停下了手中的筷子。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm31"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不过…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「没办法作为参加者去一起玩，还是有些遗憾的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm30h"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「尤其是，现在有朋也你…有我的男朋友在的时候。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「没办法两人一起参加这样的活动。让我非常的懊悔。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不过…这也是没办法的事情吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「不过…我想试试看。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「就算只有一点点时间也好…就算只有１０分钟也好。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我想和你一起度过。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「一起去参观班级的展示，一起去逛模拟店。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别勉强了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「应该没问题才对。当天没有那么多事情需要我去做的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吗…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那我也想这样呢…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「想和你一起参加看看。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯…我努力试试看。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好，我很期待哦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘎吱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原回来了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这可是特制玉露的最高级茶叶。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「嗯，谢谢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「春原，抱歉，我也要。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不能一起说吗！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm22"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「朋也，我分你一半好了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，我也不是想喝茶，只是想看看春原抓狂的样子而已，还是你喝吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你真的很闲啊！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgtm10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"智代","text":"「我们已经说完了，你可以在这待下去了哦。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「总觉得这个房间渐渐变得不再是我的房间了…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没办法，谁让有一半是我们的呢。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「全部，都是我的！」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"jumpScene","scene":2511,"entry":0},{"op":"return"}]